  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.137` to `4.1.138`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.137...application_builder_helpers/4.1.138)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): preserve empty-string in ValueBinder so required check fires (Fixes #433) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/439\n* refactor(cli): extract CompletionGateway from parser (Fixes #435) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/440\n* fix(cli): secret-redaction bypass on --no-<valued-secret>=value (Fixes #432) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/441\n* fix(cli): completion-install hardening — exe validation, fish path, rc lock, absolute XDG (Fixes #434) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/442\n* fix(cli): shared CommandErrorFooter resolver (Fixes #438, root cause: copy-paste footer drift) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/443\n* refactor(cli): move ParseResult to own file (Fixes #437) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/444\n* Bump Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions and Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/333\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20260915114545.81b0995...build.20260915103759.e97b89a",
